        "original_id": "05d85433-5ac6-58c6-bbc2-1dd38257456e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hernán Crespo, Matías Almeyda, Sérgio Conceição\n- Organizations: Parma A.C., Lazio, C.D. Guadalajara\n- Roles: striker, defensive midfielder, manager\n- Events: transfer deal after the 1999–2000 Parma A.C. season\n\nFacts:\n- In the summer after the 1999–2000 Parma A.C. season, Hernán Crespo left Parma A.C. and signed with Lazio for a then-world record transfer fee.\n- The transfer deal that sent Hernán Crespo to Lazio brought Matías Almeyda and Sérgio Conceição to Parma A.C.\n- Matías Jesús Almeyda was born on 21 December 1973.\n- Matías Almeyda is an Argentine retired footballer who played as a defensive midfielder.\n- Matías Almeyda is the current manager of Mexican club C.D. Guadalajara.",
